#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:479
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_BrineyLandedInSlateportDeliverGoods"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\n"
"We've made land in SLATEPORT!\p"
"I suppose you're going to visit CAPT.\n"
"STERN and deliver the DEVON GOODS?$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：喂！我们到凯那市啦！\p"
"你是要去找楠木船长，\n"
"把得文的物品交给他吧？$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:485
msgctxt "Route109_Text_BrineySailToDewfordQuestion"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: I thought you're supposed\n"
"to deliver the DEVON GOODS.\p"
"Would you like to sail back to\n"
"DEWFORD, then?$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：\n"
"我还以为你要去送得文的物品呢。\p"
"那么，你要坐船回武斗镇吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:491
msgctxt "Route109_Text_BrineyDewfordItIs"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: DEWFORD it is, then!\p"
"Anchors aweigh!\n"
"PEEKO, we're setting sail, my darling!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：那就去武斗镇！\p"
"起锚啦！皮可，\n"
"我们要出航了，我的宝贝！$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:496
msgctxt "Route109_Text_BrineyDeliverDevonGoods"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Then you go on and deliver\n"
"the DEVON GOODS. I'll be waiting.$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：那你就去把得文的\n"
"物品送过去吧。我会在这里等你的。$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:500
msgctxt "DewfordTown_Text_BrineyLandedInSlateport"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy! We've made land in\n"
"SLATEPORT!\p"
"You just go on and tell me whenever\n"
"you want to set sail again!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：喂！我们到凯那市啦！\p"
"什么时候想再出海，随时告诉我就行！$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:506
msgctxt "Route109_Text_BrineyWhereAreWeBound"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: Ahoy!\n"
"For you, I'll go out to sea anytime!\p"
"Now, my friend, where are we bound?$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：喂！为了你，\n"
"我随时都可以出海！\p"
"那么，我的朋友，我们要去哪里呢？$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:511
msgctxt "Route109_Text_BrineyTellMeWhenYouNeedToSail"
msgid ""
"MR. BRINEY: You just tell me whenever\n"
"you need to set sail again!$"
msgstr ""
"哈奇老人：什么时候需要再出海，\n"
"随时告诉我就行！$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:515
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ChillAtMyPapasSpot"
msgid ""
"Yo, TRAINERS!\n"
"Whether you're hot to trot,\l"
"or cool cat not,\l"
"chill at my papa's spot!$"
msgstr ""
"哟，训练家们！不管你是热血沸腾还是冷\n"
"静淡定，都来我爸爸的店里歇歇脚吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:521
msgctxt "Route109_Text_LittleKidsDartAround"
msgid ""
"Little kids can dart around so quickly…\p"
"You don't dare take your eyes off them\n"
"for an instant. It's very taxing.\p"
"Mine are with my POKéMON, so they\n"
"should be okay, but…$"
msgstr ""
"小孩子跑来跑去的，动作可快了……\p"
"一刻都不能把视线从他们身上移开。\n"
"真是累人啊。\p"
"不过我家孩子有我的宝可梦陪着，\n"
"应该没问题，可是……$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:528
msgctxt "Route109_Text_SandCastleTakingLongTime"
msgid ""
"Our sand castle's taking a long time\n"
"to make.$"
msgstr "我们的沙堡要花好长时间才能堆好。$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:532
msgctxt "Route109_Text_YouCanHaveThis"
msgid "You can have this!$"
msgstr "这个给你吧！$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:535
msgctxt "Route109_Text_WereGoingToMakeBigCastle"
msgid ""
"We're going to get all the sand from\n"
"the beach and make a big castle!\p"
"And then we're going to be a king and\n"
"queen.\p"
"We'll let you be a servant.$"
msgstr ""
"我们要把海滩上的沙子全部拿来，\n"
"堆一座大城堡！\p"
"然后我们就要当国王和王后。\p"
"就让你来当仆人吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:542
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ZigzagoonPicksUpLitter"
msgid ""
"The water around these parts is clean.\p"
"But, I get my ZIGZAGOON to pick up\n"
"litter from the shoreline at times.\p"
"Dirty water becomes rain and joins our\n"
"rivers, which we drink from…\p"
"If we pollute the sea, it all comes\n"
"back to haunt us eventually.$"
msgstr ""
"这一带的海水很干净。\p"
"不过，我有时候还是会让我的\n"
"蛇纹熊去捡海岸边的垃圾。\p"
"脏水会变成雨，流进我们喝水的河里……\p"
"要是污染了大海，\n"
"最终都会报应到我们自己身上。$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:551
msgctxt "Route109_Text_ZigzagoonCry"
msgid "ZIGZAGOON: Guguu?$"
msgstr "蛇纹熊：咕咕——？$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:554
msgctxt "Route109_Text_SeashoreHouseSign"
msgid ""
"SEASHORE HOUSE\p"
"“May hot battles rage on hot sands!\n"
"The place for hot TRAINERS!”$"
msgstr ""
"海之家\p"
"“在火热的沙滩上展开火热的对战吧！\n"
"火热训练家的聚集地！”$"

#: data/maps/Route109/scripts.inc:559
msgctxt "Route109_Text_TrainerTipsSign"
msgid ""
"TRAINER TIPS\p"
"POKéMON at the same level may not\n"
"always have identical stats.\p"
"POKéMON raised by TRAINERS are said\n"
"to grow stronger than wild POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"训练家小知识\p"
"即使是同样等级的宝可梦，\n"
"能力也不一定完全相同。\p"
"据说由训练家培养的\n"
"宝可梦会比野生宝可梦成长得更强。$"
